<title>GERMANY: Munich air cargo up 27.7 pct in October 1996.</title>
<headline>Munich air cargo up 27.7 pct in October 1996.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total air cargo handled at Munich airport in October was 27.7 percent up on year traffic, airport authority figures showed.</p>
<p>All figures are in tonnes with percentage changes from year ago figures:</p>
<p>	   Total		 Percent</p>
<p>	   traffic	     change</p>
<p> Aug     5,947		 up 15.5</p>
<p> Sept    6,464		 up 13.5</p>
<p> Oct     7,137		 up 27.7</p>
<p>	   Exports  Pct	  Imports  Change</p>
<p> Aug     2,942    up  5.7    3,005    up 27.1</p>
<p> Sept    3,223    up  5.7    3,241    up 22.5</p>
<p> Oct     3,622    up 24.4    3,515    up 31.2</p>
<p>Source: Flughafen Muenchen GmbH, traffic statistics dept. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
